{"type": "system_only", "pmcid": "PMC12696593", "metric": "MD", "value": 28.0, "ci": null, "attribution": "own", "sentence": "Using a noninformative prior distribution, the mean difference in the number of days alive and free from mechanical ventilation within 28 days between the APP group and the standard care group was 0.33 (95% CrI, −1.37 to 2.03) days."}
